    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20053" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλάστ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλαστός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				276
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
